        <!-- ===================== Executive Summary ===================== -->
        <div class="fhc-card mb-4">
            <div class="fhc-section-label"><i class="bi bi-stars"></i>Executive Summary</div>
            <p class="exec-summary mb-0">
                <strong>UCN Fibrenet Private Limited</strong> earns an overall Financial Health Score of
                <strong>718 / 1000</strong>, placing it in the <strong>Good</strong> band. The business shows
                <strong>strong compliance</strong> (150/150) with every expected GST return filed, healthy
                <strong>cash-flow coverage</strong> (170/200) with a DSCR of 10.00x and 365 days of cash on hand, and
                <strong>stable business fundamentals</strong> (134/150) backed by an established Udyam registration and
                a diversified HSN mix. The main watch-item is <strong>banking penetration</strong> — GST-declared
                turnover of ₹2.99 Cr/month is not fully mirrored in the consented bank account, so it's worth
                confirming this is the primary operating account before finalising limits. No cross-source income
                mismatch or credit-bureau adverse history was found; ITR financials were unavailable for this cycle.
            </p>
